WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
A brand asks for two posts
and paid usage.

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:04.980
The important details are missing.

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:10.520
Rosalia gets the deadline, the fee,
how long they need the posts, and a contact.

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:18.140
Ava sets the terms, 800 euros, and
three months of usage, not 12.

5
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.980
Rosalia sends that reply.
